  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Protection; <strong>CL</strong> 3rd<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> slotless; <strong>Price</strong> 18,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 3 lbs.</p>\n<p>Negaters are usually simple black spheres carved with runes that help repel magic. When held, these +1 Protection implements grant access to the Spell Ward (aegis, ward) talent, allowing the user an opportunity to repress magic in an area or grant spell resistance to an ally.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Implement Of Power, Protection sphere (Spell Ward (aegis, ward)); <strong>Cost</strong> 9,000 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/implements#toc22\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
